### listing all assigned projects

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/assigned-projects/


### Creating an assigned project

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/assigned-projects/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "project": 1,
    "coordinator": 20,
    "developers": [21, 24, 29],
    "duration": 30,
    "start_date": "2026-11-11",
    "tentative_end_date": "2026-12-11"
}


### Retrieve an assigned projects

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/assigned-projects/e786f754-1c3f-4174-a86f-7cfc820a10a8/


### Update an assigned project

PATCH  http://127.0.0.1:8000/assigned-projects/e786f754-1c3f-4174-a86f-7cfc820a10a8/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "duration":8 
}


### Delete an assigned projects

DELETE  http://127.0.0.1:8000/assigned-projects/e786f754-1c3f-4174-a86f-7cfc820a10a8/
